Convert a CSV export to JSON.

Usage: ok cli_short_help.ok <input> [--out <path>] [--verbose] [--quiet] [--tag <value>] [--role <admin|user>] [--force]

Arguments:
  <input>                  file to read

Options:
  -o, --out <path>         where to write the JSON [default: out.json]
  -v, --verbose            print each row
  -q, --quiet              print nothing
  -t, --tag <value>        tags to add (repeatable)
  -r, --role <admin|user>  [default: user]
      --force              overwrite the output
  -h, --help               print this help
